{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：18:11 2026-11-02 HKT</p>\n<p>銅鑼灣怡和街及軒尼詩道交界的行人過路處，今日（11月2日）再有網民拍攝到跨境車輛違規情況。片段所見，今次涉案的是一部黑色七人車，有內地及港澳三地車牌。</p>\n<p>當時司機不知何故駛上了電車路，然後視正線車輛和圍觀途人如無物，在斑馬線上打着死火燈調頭，逼得正線車輛不敢駛出綠燈。隨後，七人車返回正線後揚長而去，交通亦陸續恢復正常。</p>\n<img alt=\"現場為銅鑼灣怡和街及軒尼詩道交界。Threads：pace_n_page\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d251fc45f5d0e15276f1e4fa7b8ce705/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-02-17h50m20s532.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"司機不知何故剷上電車路。Threads：pace_n_page\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/73cd73578f3ac1ca524bbc560a29d1b4/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-02-17h50m26s003.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"司機於過路處調頭，視其他車輛及圍觀途人如無物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e98db2115182e08f058cb1d6a74d0547/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-02-17h50m34s826.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"司機於過路處調頭，視其他車輛及圍觀途人如無物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/600a4786ff93dde3fe63a4200db0e5cf/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-02-17h50m46s567.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"司機事後揚長而去。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ede49d4fa7a1544d05dc34df5a3ed6f/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-02-17h50m58s624.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"司機事後揚長而去。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0dd33a3308185e6fa380152739ac27d8/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-02-17h51m03s726.png\"/>\n<p>目擊者稱已通知警方跟進，而片段亦引起網民討論，直言「大地任我行」、「銅鑼灣揸fit人，點行就點行」、「呢啲司機唔可以放過」、「要重罰，停牌，扣車」</p>\n<h2>10月20日同一過路處亦有FU牌私家車違規</h2>\n<p>10月20日下午約2時，同一過路處亦有FU牌跨境私家車駛上行人路，近距離駛過途人，險象環生。當時港島總區交通調查組經深入調查及翻查相關片段後，10月23日成功鎖定涉案車輛，並檢控一名56歲涉案男司機。</p>\n<img alt=\"一部FU牌銀色私家車突然剷上怡和街和記利佐治街之間的行人過路處。Threads：05wongmafansThreads：\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4241f19637d581e835c1208aeac059ad/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h02m33s320.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"途人面面相覷。Threads：05wongmafansThreads：\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37c801e6da922cb62588751785595433/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h02m58s464.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"事件引來途人圍觀。Threads：05wongmafansThreads：\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d8c082bebeb9cb653a6ace6e8e36e14/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h17m39s539.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"FU牌私家車最後返回怡和街駛走。Threads：05wongmafansThreads：\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/633ae65f394e925cd7a263935572ad5f/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h17m27s772.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"FU牌私家車最後返回怡和街駛走。Threads：05wongmafansThreads：\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a2a058b43e7b26de6034173709bdc23/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h03m06s121.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T10:21:18.523554+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":382,"images":11,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:11:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:18:30.501885+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T10:18:36.010847+00:00","content_hash":"087d4167bee2a2de3452a0d7c9811f09543203c576ca0f9bc839f885c9b665c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}